==Russian==

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}} {{qualifier|{{m|ru|подо-}} is used before certain consonant clusters}}

# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[upwards]] {{gloss|describing an action of moving from the bottom up}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[бро́сить]]|''(pf.)'' to throw|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подбро́сить]]|''(pf.)'' to throw upwards|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[closer]] {{gloss|describing an action of approaching to an entity}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[идти́]]|''(impf.)'' to go (by walking)|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подойти́]]|''(pf.)'' to walk up to, to approach (by walking)|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} [[adding]] {{gloss|describing an action of adding more entity}}
#:* {{ux|ru|бавить|an archaic [[causative]] form of [[быть]] that depends on verbal prefixes in contemporary usage|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подба́вить]]|''(pf.)'' to add, replenish|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{gloss|describing a meaning that shows a finished action or an obtainment of a result}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[стричь]]|''(impf.)'' to cut|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подстри́чь]]|''(pf.)'' to cut|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[писа́ть]]|''(impf.)'' to write|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подписа́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to sign, to subscribe (in the sense of writing one's name with a result)|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{gloss|describing an action of copying or following someone's action}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[да]]|yes|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подда́кивать]]|''(impf.)'' to say yes, assent (in the sense echoing "yes")|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with verbs}} {{gloss|describing an existence of the certain action that is weak, invisible, hidden or incomplete}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[уста́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to get tired|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подуста́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to get tired slightly or lightly|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[слать]]|''(pf.)'' to send, dispatch|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подосла́ть]]|''(pf.)'' to send something (secretly)|inline=y}}

===Prefix===
{{head|ru|prefix|cat2=verbal prefixes}} {{qualifier|{{m|ru|подо-}} is used before certain consonant clusters}}

# {{lb|ru|used with nouns}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns or adjectives; describing an existence of being under or beneath something}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[земля́]]|ground|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подзе́мный]]|underground|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with nouns}} [[sub]]
#:* {{ux|ru|[[гру́ппа]]|group|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подгру́ппа]]|subgroup|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with nouns}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns or adjectives; describing an influence under something}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[власть]]|authority, control|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подвла́стный]]|subjected, dependant|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with nouns}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns or adjectives; describing an existence of being around something}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[Карпа́ты]]|[[Carpathians]] (mountains)|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[Подкарпа́тский]]|Subcarpathian (cf. Подкарпатье / Subcarpathia)|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with nouns}} {{gloss|resulting in nouns; describing an title or position below the superior}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[ма́стер]]|master|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подмасте́рье]]|apprentice|inline=y}}
# {{lb|ru|used with adjectives}} {{gloss|adverbs; describing completeness}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[чи́стый]]|clean|inline=y}}
#:* {{ux|ru|[[подчисту́ю]]|without remainder|inline=y}}

====Usage notes====
* In the meaning of ''closer'', only use под- when the subject is in the sight range of the object of interest, and then moves even closer towards it.
:* {{ru-ux|[[я|Я]] [[подойти|подошла]] [[к]] [[памятник|памятнику]].|I walked up to the statue. (I already was in the same room or space with it, and then walked closer to it.)}}
:* {{ru-ux|[[я|Я]] [[прийти|пришла]] [[к]] [[памятник|памятнику]].|I arrived at the statue. (I came to the statue from somewhere further.)}}

